			title = "Ironfel",
			hint = "Recover the architect's hammer and return it to his hands.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 3802 },
			},
			text = [=[After his death, Ironfel passed to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire, a {link:dwarves}dwarf{/link} Franclorn holds in contempt for his low motives and small talent. Darkvire cannot master the hammer. Franclorn fears the builder who might come after him, one skilled enough to wield Ironfel fully and to make works of ruin with it. So he asked that Darkvire be slain and the hammer set in the grip of his statue. There Ironfel is locked for good. Should anyone try to take it back, statue and hammer will shatter together. And when the hammer slides into place, the compartment at the statue's foot opens, and the master key of the city lies within.]=],
