			text = [=[Lothos Riftwaker is a mage who has made his post in a small stone chamber at the foot of the great chains, beside the gates of the Dark Iron city. He is a student of rifts. He teaches that the fabric of the world is delicate, and that whoever knows enough can tear it. Not two paces from where he stands, he says, such a tear already runs through the depths of the mountain and into the lair of the Firelord.]=],
